        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Blumenia</i></strong> is a visual novel where its characters represent each a real life plant. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet its characters and discover their stories and the things that make each of them unique.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>An adventure against time</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their world is affected by a drought and they need to find the solution before it's too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A clue takes our protagonists into a journey between The Four Seasons, where they'll meet other plants and face different problems in each season.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the truth of their world and bring back things to normality!</p>",
